          "index": 0,
          "candidate_answer": null,
          "reply": "Good morning Daniel, it's a pleasure to meet you. My name is Emily Chen, and I'll be conducting your interview today. Welcome to the role of Data Analyst at our organization, and thank you for taking the time to speak with me. Can you start by telling me a little bit about yourself and why you're interested in this Data Analyst position?",
