          "effective_difficulty": "medium",
          "index": 1,
          "candidate_answer": "Thanks for seeing me. I'm a data analyst with about two years at Mercia Retail Group. I own the weekly sales performance pack that goes to regional managers, and I built the stock availability dashboard in Power BI. My background is economics, so I came in strong on statistics and I've been building up the SQL and Python side since."
        },
