          "reply": "Your experience in Power BI has been particularly impressive, and it's great to hear that you've been able to make a tangible impact on your team's workflow. Can you elaborate on what you did to identify the key data point that made the flag truly useful, and how you ensured that the dashboard was still easy to understand for non-technical stakeholders?",
