          "finished": false,
          "follow_up": false,
          "effective_difficulty": "medium",
          "index": 2,
          "candidate_answer": "The stock availability dashboard is the work I'd point to. Before it, store managers were getting a spreadsheet emailed on Monday that was already two days stale. I rebuilt it in Power BI against the nightly load so it refreshes every morning, and I added a flag for lines that had been out of stock more than three days. That flag was the bit people actually used."
        },
