          "reply": "That's a great example of your analytical skills, Daniel. I'm impressed by how you were able to identify the root cause of the discrepancy and implement a solution to prevent it from happening again. Can you walk me through your thought process behind deciding to add a duplicate check into the load, and how you ensured that this query wouldn't impact the overall performance of the nightly load?",
