          "effective_difficulty": "medium",
          "index": 3,
          "candidate_answer": "I found a discrepancy in the weekly numbers where the total didn't reconcile with finance. I traced it back to the nightly load, and it turned out a store that had changed its ID was being counted twice for a four-day window. I wrote a duplicate check into the load and added a reconciliation query that runs before the pack goes out."
